<h2>SFTP Campaign — Connection Error</h2>

<p>The SFTP campaign watcher failed to connect to the remote SFTP server.</p>

<table style="border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Error:</td>
    <td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><code><%= @exception_message %></code></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>Please verify the SFTP server settings in the Super Admin console:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Host and port are correct and reachable</li>
  <li>Username is valid</li>
  <li>Private key or password is properly configured</li>
  <li>The remote path exists and is accessible</li>
</ul>
